PokemonMansion_2F_Text_ProfOakIntro::
    .string "You've caught me in a moment of\n"
    .string "deep research.\p"
    .string "This mansion holds secrets of a\n"
    .string "POKéMON barely more than a\l"
    .string "whisper in ancient texts.\p"
    .string "Looking at the story of MEWTWO,\n"
    .string "one ponders its origins...\p"
    .string "I spent many years exploring\n"
    .string "the region to discover every\l"
    .string "species.\p"
    .string "There were a few, however.\n"
    .string "They were so powerful,\n"
    .string "so rare,\p"
    .string "I had to keep their capture\n"
    .string "hidden.\p"
    .string "In learning of MEWTWO's\n"
    .string "creation, it seems my\l"
    .string "fears were well placed.\p"
    .string "Not all are capable of wielding\n"
    .string "such power.\p"
    .string "But let's focus on the present.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "You have become a POKéMON\n"
    .string "master above all others.\p"
    .string "Our battle has showed me back\n"
    .string "to the path of strength.\p"
    .string "Now, I challenge you with my\n"
    .string "full, unrestrained power.\p"
    .string "Might I test your\n"
    .string "might once more?$"

PokemonMansion_2F_Text_ProfOakDeclined::
    .string "Perhaps it's best to wait\n"
    .string "until the time feels right.$"

PokemonMansion_2F_Text_ProfOakAccepted::
    .string "May our battle echo\n"
    .string "through these halls.\p"
    .string "Prepare yourself!$"

PokemonMansion_2F_Text_ProfOakDefeat::
    .string "This defeat teaches me more\n"
    .string "than any victory.$"

PokemonMansion_2F_Text_DefeatedProfOak::
    .string "Our clash today stirred the\n"
    .string "very air itself.\p"
    .string "There's a certain energy\n"
    .string "in this place,\l"
    .string "ripe with possibility.\p"
    .string "Keep your senses sharp.\p"
    .string "The world is full of wonders\n"
    .string "waiting to reveal themselves\l"
    .string "to the worthy.\p"
    .string "Who knows what mysteries\n"
    .string "may unfold next?$"

PokemonMansion_2F_Text_MewText::
 .string "MEW...$"
